[statement]
A package needed through a name it provides at no version does not follow
the package that needed it at once: `w`, which `y` needs by its own name,
follows `y`; `x`, which provides `v`, goes after the first removals, before
the packages installed.

[repository]
P:b
V:1

[installed]
P:x
V:1
p:v

P:w
V:1

P:y
V:1
D:v w

[request]
b

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
remove y 1
remove w 1
remove x 1
install b 1
